Right trusty and well-beloved,

I report that the royal barge repairs proceeds well and will be finished by m=
onth's end.

I trust this note finds you all in one piece.

Ever at your command,
Queen Jane Seymour

--
Confidential =E2=80=94 for the eyes of the Privy Council only.

